  "code": "---\ntitle: Avatar\ndesc: Avatars are used to show a thumbnail representation of an individual or business in the interface.\nsource: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saadeghi/daisyui/refs/heads/master/packages/daisyui/src/components/avatar.css\nlayout: components\nclassnames:\n  component:\n    - class: avatar\n      desc: Avatar\n    - class: avatar-group\n      desc: Container for multiple avatars\n  modifier:\n    - class: avatar-online\n      desc: shows a green dot as online indicator\n    - class: avatar-offline\n      desc: shows a gray dot as offline indicator\n    - class: avatar-placeholder\n      desc: To show letters as avatar placeholder\n---\n\n<script>\n  import Component from \"$components/Component.svelte\"\n  import Translate from \"$components/Translate.svelte\"\n</script>\n\n### ~Avatar\n\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/batperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/batperson@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### ~Avatar in custom sizes\n\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/superperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-16 rounded bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/superperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 rounded bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/superperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-8 rounded bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/superperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-32 rounded\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/superperson@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-20 rounded\">\n    <img\n      src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/superperson@192.webp\"\n      alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\"\n    />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-16 rounded\">\n    <img\n      src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/superperson@192.webp\"\n      alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\"\n    />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-8 rounded\">\n    <img\n      src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/superperson@192.webp\"\n      alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\"\n    />\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### ~Avatar rounded\n\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-xl bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/yellingwoman@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-full bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/yellingcat@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-xl\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/yellingwoman@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-full\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/yellingcat@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### ~Avatar with mask\n\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 mask mask-heart bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/distracted3@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 mask mask-squircle bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/distracted1@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 mask mask-hexagon-2 bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/distracted2@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"$$mask $$mask-heart w-24\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/distracted3@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"$$mask $$mask-squircle w-24\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/distracted1@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"$$mask $$mask-hexagon-2 w-24\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/distracted2@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### ~Avatar group\n\n<div class=\"avatar-group -space-x-6\">\n  <div class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12 bg-base-300\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/batperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12 bg-base-300\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/spiderperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12 bg-base-300\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/averagebulk@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12 bg-base-300\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/wonderperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar-group -space-x-6\">\n  <div class=\"$$avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12\">\n      <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/batperson@192.webp\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"$$avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12\">\n      <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/spiderperson@192.webp\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"$$avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12\">\n      <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/averagebulk@192.webp\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"$$avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12\">\n      <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/wonderperson@192.webp\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### ~Avatar group with counter\n\n<div class=\"avatar-group -space-x-6\">\n  <div class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12  bg-base-300\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/batperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12  bg-base-300\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/spiderperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12  bg-base-300\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/averagebulk@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"avatar avatar-placeholder\">\n    <div class=\"w-12 bg-neutral text-neutral-content\">\n      <span>+99</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar-group -space-x-6\">\n  <div class=\"$$avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12\">\n      <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/batperson@192.webp\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"$$avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12\">\n      <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/spiderperson@192.webp\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"$$avatar\">\n    <div class=\"w-12\">\n      <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/averagebulk@192.webp\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"$$avatar $$avatar-placeholder\">\n    <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content w-12\">\n      <span>+99</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### ~Avatar with ring\n\n<div class=\"avatar\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-full ring-2 ring-primary ring-offset-base-100 ring-offset-2\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/spiderperson@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar\">\n  <div class=\"ring-primary ring-offset-base-100 w-24 rounded-full ring-2 ring-offset-2\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/spiderperson@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### ~Avatar with presence indicator\n\n<div class=\"avatar avatar-online\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-full bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/gordon@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar avatar-offline\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-full bg-base-300\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/idiotsandwich@192.webp\" alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar $$avatar-online\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-full\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/gordon@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar $$avatar-offline\">\n  <div class=\"w-24 rounded-full\">\n    <img alt=\"Tailwind-CSS-Avatar-component\" src=\"https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/idiotsandwich@192.webp\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### ~Avatar placeholder\n\n<div class=\"avatar avatar-placeholder\">\n  <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content rounded-full w-24\">\n    <span class=\"text-3xl\">D</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar avatar-online avatar-placeholder\">\n  <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content rounded-full w-16\">\n    <span class=\"text-xl\">AI</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar avatar-placeholder\">\n  <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content rounded-full w-12\">\n    <span>SY</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"avatar avatar-placeholder\">\n  <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content rounded-full w-8\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs\">UI</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<div class=\"$$avatar $$avatar-placeholder\">\n  <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content w-24 rounded-full\">\n    <span class=\"text-3xl\">D</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar $$avatar-online $$avatar-placeholder\">\n  <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content w-16 rounded-full\">\n    <span class=\"text-xl\">AI</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar $$avatar-placeholder\">\n  <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content w-12 rounded-full\">\n    <span>SY</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"$$avatar $$avatar-placeholder\">\n  <div class=\"bg-neutral text-neutral-content w-8 rounded-full\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs\">UI</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n",
